# QUESTION: Does explicit install help discover the default installation and
# every existing installation target without running an installation?
# The functional route checks the built binary's linked default and target
# registrations together; a dispatcher unit cannot prove that composition.
# Bare ze install intentionally installs the host (docs/guide/ze-install.md).

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze install --help
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stderr:contains=local
expect=stderr:contains=remote
expect=stderr:contains=systemd
expect=stderr:contains=(no target)
expect=stderr:contains=ze install [target] [options]
